### KahootP46 Live — ejemplos REST (IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client)
# Define en tu entorno local: host (http://localhost:4200), adminEmail, adminPassword. No guardes credenciales aquí.

### 1. Login admin
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{adminEmail}}", "password": "{{adminPassword}}" }

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 2. Crear un quiz
# @name quiz
POST {{host}}/api/quizzes
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Historia del Ecuador",
  "questions": [
    {
      "text": "¿Cuál es la capital del Ecuador?",
      "timeLimit": 20,
      "choices": [
        { "text": "Guayaquil", "correct": false },
        { "text": "Quito", "correct": true },
        { "text": "Cuenca", "correct": false },
        { "text": "Loja", "correct": false }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

> {% client.global.set("quizId", response.body.id); %}

### 3. Crear partida (genera el PIN)
# @name game
POST {{host}}/api/host/games
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quizId": "{{quizId}}" }

> {% client.global.set("gameId", response.body.id); client.global.set("pin", response.body.pin); %}

### 4. Viewer: conectar con el PIN
# @name connect
POST {{host}}/api/games/connect
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pin": "{{pin}}" }

> {% client.global.set("viewerToken", response.body.viewerToken); %}

### 5. Iniciar partida (QUESTION_STARTED)
POST {{host}}/api/host/games/{{gameId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. Pregunta actual (sin respuesta hasta el reveal)
GET {{host}}/api/games/{{pin}}/current
Authorization: Bearer {{viewerToken}}

### 7. Revelar (ANSWER_REVEALED)
POST {{host}}/api/host/games/{{gameId}}/reveal
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8. Historial
GET {{host}}/api/games/{{pin}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{viewerToken}}

### 9. Siguiente / terminar
POST {{host}}/api/host/games/{{gameId}}/next
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 10. Cerrar partida
POST {{host}}/api/host/games/{{gameId}}/finish
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
